== ui_card "Card Helper"
  p.sp-text-muted <code>ui_card(title = nil, **options, &block)</code>

  h3 Philosophy
  p Cards are the fundamental containers in Slim-Pickins. They group related information and actions, providing a "paper-like" surface hierarchy.
  ul
    li <strong>Encapsulation:</strong> Keeps content visually distinct from the background.
    li <strong>Structure:</strong> Enforces a standard header/body layout (optional header).
    li <strong>Modularity:</strong> Easily nestable and composable.

  h3 Arguments
  table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 2rem;"
    thead style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--sp-border);"
      tr
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Name
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Type
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Description
    tbody
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" title
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" String (Optional)
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" If provided, renders a header section with this title.
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" options
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Hash
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Standard HTML attributes (e.g., <code>class</code>, <code>id</code>).
      tr
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" block
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Block
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" The content to render inside the card body.

  h3 Real World Scenarios
  
  h4 1. Standard Content Container
  p The most common use case: wrapping a section of content.
  
  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      == ui_card "Project Alpha" do
        p Status: Active
        p Due: Tomorrow
      
      pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 1rem;"
        code
          | == ui_card "Project Alpha" do
              p Status: Active
              p Due: Tomorrow

  h4 2. Headless Card
  p Use a card without a title for simple grouping.
  
  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      == ui_card do
        p Just some grouped text without a header.
      
      pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 1rem;"
        code
          | == ui_card do
              p Just some grouped text without a header.
